      "options": {
        "content": "## Go / DB metrics\n\nThis repo currently provisions **Loki + Grafana logs only** (no Prometheus datasource).\n\nThe Go service exposes **authenticated JSON** at `GET /metrics` (Go latency p50/p95/p99, status_4xx/status_5xx, goroutines, heap+GC, and `database/sql` pool stats).\n\nTo dashboard these values as graphs, you’ll need to wire `/metrics` into Prometheus (or add a Grafana JSON datasource). Until then, use `/metrics` + `curl`/k6 snapshots during load to populate the report.\n",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Go / DB metrics (not yet dashboarded)",
      "type": "text"
    },
