      "options": {
        "content": "## Missing exporters / Next.js request timing\n\nRequested Phase 5 panels for:\n\n- Postgres exporter metrics\n- Nginx request/conn/response timing + upstream errors\n- Next.js request rate/latency/errors\n\nare **not available** in this repo because no Prometheus scrape targets / exporters are present.\n\nYou can still approximate some error rates via Loki (api gateway logs), but latency percentiles for Next.js and upstream timings require exporter metrics.\n",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Exporter gaps",
